{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if your soul refused to move on?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>One Last Journey</i>, you play as <strong>Selene</strong> and <strong>Aurel</strong>, two souls caught between life and the afterlife. Explore a hauntingly beautiful world of forgotten cities, broken memories, and ghostlight ruins as you uncover the bond that once bound you\u2014and the silence that tore it apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=808 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/ddda1bbf634d4ad106b7c073c2a0bbd2.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dual Narrative:</strong>\u00a0Switch between Selene and Aurel, as their paths echo through time \u2014 one in the present, one lost in the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World:</strong>\u00a0Explore handcrafted pixel environments from the corrupted sewers to the soul-lit city of Echohold and the darkness below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storytelling:</strong>\u00a0Uncover a tale of love, regret, and remembrance told through dialogue, found memories, and environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey to the End:</strong>\u00a0There are no branching paths, no choices to undo. This is one last journey \u2014 and it only ends one way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=808 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Movement:</strong>\u00a0Use spirit abilities like dashing \u00a0or wielding spectral sword in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=922 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Where am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3801030/bfa35269d7b90979b3f1cda52d41eef19323a72f.jpg"},{"name":"Descent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3801030/a7a4f1ff2b1a0fcd29e869794bec6d596a85853c.jpg"},{"name":"Inner demon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images