ue, found memories, and environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey to the End:</strong>\u00a0There are no branching paths, no choices to undo. This is one last journey \u2014 and it only ends one way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=808 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/d08302dcb5cba858fbd8bc93f4dd1093.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Movement:</strong>\u00a0Use spirit abilities like dashing \u00a0or wielding spectral sword in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.poster.avif?t=1767401864\" width=922 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.webm?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801030/extras/fbc15505c8a723e17ca4b1141939ec5b.mp4?t=1767401864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["RosarioMuerto"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://share